  "description": "Sharia law is a system of religious law derived from the Quran and Hadith, governing aspects of life for Muslims, including personal conduct, family law, and criminal law. It is often misunderstood or misrepresented in Western contexts as inherently oppressive or incompatible with modern democratic values, which is a central theme in the meme's hostile intent.",
